        <activityName xml:lang="en">Complex Set Top Boxes (CSTB), for customer premise equipment (CPE)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Complex Set Top Boxes (CSTB), for customer premise equipment (CPE)
The data set represents the CSTB networks in Switzerland; UUID: fc2c9f42-0324-30e0-b60f-33caf2b2d892
Dataset is based on an average of 6 different complex set top boxes (CSTB) types. Power supply unit assumed to be 1.5019 kg/p (UVEK) and router to be 0.58 kg/pcs (UVEK). HDD weight is assumed to be 0.45 kg/p (UVEK). Total weight is therefore 1.42 kg. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: Swiss use CSTB transmission networks.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fc2c9f42-0324-30e0-b60f-33caf2b2d892.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
